# Testing & Verification Standards

## 1. Test Architecture
- Write tests alongside new feature code (TDD / Test-first approach).
- Use `pytest` for Python projects and `vitest` / `jest` for TypeScript/JavaScript.
- Isolate external dependencies using mocks, fixtures, or local test doubles. Never call live production APIs in unit tests.

## 2. Test Coverage & Edge Cases
- Test the happy path AND critical edge cases (empty inputs, null values, network timeouts, invalid formats).
- Assert specific expected behaviors and error messages, not just generic boolean flags.
